  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Farman Khan vs State Of U.P. And 2 Others on 12 July, 2021 Bench: Naheed Ara Moonis, Saumitra Dayal Singh High Court Of Judicature At Allahabad ?Court No. - 3 Case :- Writ - C No. - 13746 of 2021 Petitioner :- Farman Khan Respondent :- State Of U.P. And 2 Others",
    "facts": "The present petition has been filed challenging the order dated 23.12.2020 passed by Additional District Magistrate (Finance & Revenue), Farrukhabad under Section 58 of Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006 (hereinafter referred to as 'Act'). Thus, it is clear that besides the statutory remedy of appeal, the petitioner may have a remedy of filing a recall application before the ADM (Finance & Revenue), Farrukhabad seeking recall of the Farman Khan vs State Of U.P. And 2 Others on 12 July, 2021 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/28524363/ 1 order dated 23.12.2020 as that application would fall within the ambit of procedural review.",
    "arguments": "Submission of learned counsel for the petitioner is that though the order dated 23.12.2020 refers to two notices issued to the petitioner, however, no notice was ever been served on the petitioner and thus no opportunity was ever granted to the petitioner to contest the proceedings.",
    "petitioner_arguments": "Submission of learned counsel for the petitioner is that though the order dated 23.12.2020 refers to two notices issued to the petitioner, however, no notice was ever been served on the petitioner and thus no opportunity was ever granted to the petitioner to contest the proceedings.",
